        "text": "Page: Sons and Lovers (1981 TV serial). Sentence: Sons and Lovers is a 1981 BBC television serial based on the D. H. Lawrence book \"Sons and Lovers\".\nPage: Sons and Lovers (1981 TV serial). Sentence: It starred Eileen Atkins, Tom Bell, Karl Johnson, Lynn Dearth and Leonie Mellinger.\nPage: Eileen Atkins. Sentence: Dame Eileen June Atkins, DBE (born 16 June 1934) is an English actress and occasional screenwriter.\nPage: Eileen Atkins. Sentence: She is also a three-time Olivier Award winner, winning Best Supporting Performance in 1988 (for Multiple roles) and Best Actress for \"The Unexpected Man\" (1999) and \"Honour\" (2004).",
